{"version":1,"key":"card:542","content":{"id":542,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"记笔记常遇到的两个误区：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f66b6ae7-5442-475f-951c-a50aa77ecd00","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"形式大于内容","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"33b08695-f1e6-4d2c-a257-624f50418709","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"常常纠结于格式，排版，字数，是否存在遗漏（比如整本书的知识点是否有遗漏），真正关心的应当是有用的信息，能不能为未来的自己所用，未来的自己会怎么用，形式是为内容服务的","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"876ed888-2ca8-4d82-a755-d79d69b07590","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"4b01f6d2-77b5-44a7-8031-eeb647ad7bd1","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"只记录，不思考","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e47b9a96-61a3-42d1-b9aa-634c2cfaa00b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"当我们觉得某段话打动我们，于是我们想记录，但是这种感觉是模糊，如果当时没有想清楚为什么需要记录，等到事后我们翻阅时一定一头雾水，因为这是没有预思考后的信息，我们要想办法把这种模糊的想法清晰化，有一个办法就是提问题：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"18fa6cd0-55f9-4e60-83f3-d5d03bd11ae5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"这个笔记对未来的我有什么用？","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d916db84-b606-490e-928f-abc2496462a5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"30d7176b-69dd-4baa-ac30-223df7010938","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"我是否经历过或看到过类似的事情？","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"142f8c7d-83d0-44b2-8c0e-ffb0bb71368c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"243efaf9-fa4e-459e-964c-2e13fccefda7","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"这个观点的过人之处在于哪里？","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"67b6f5b5-f7c2-4e07-8770-947f7d682491","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"6af4ebbf-6a58-4748-9378-acd3b96d7fc0","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"这个理论适合在什么样的场景下用？","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b897040e-bb0a-4401-b3b0-1d1f2d95ead7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"fae54792-82df-46a4-a85c-65977f884764","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"...","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"808eb934-cad0-4fa1-8c37-d998e466ca06","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"be401275-4dda-40fd-b3f1-6d488a5de25b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"bb22ad46-a434-433f-adc3-d0a778b262c0","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"总而言之，不要做知识的搬运工","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f5ca176a-3a12-4e20-80fd-e8bd04b61c26","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"06e4cb14-8ba6-47c3-aa8a-4efd495de63d","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c3177